puppet-c (0.0.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release
  * libpuppetc: Puppet language parser and interpreter
  * libfacter_c: Native fact collection
  * puppetc: CLI tool for manifest debugging
  * puppetc-server: HTTP catalog compilation server
  * puppetc-agent: Agent with resource application

